office-part:Evangelium;
occasion:Dominica in Ramis Palmarum (Missale O.P. 1939, p. 139);
book:set to the Dominican Gospel tone, Processionarium O.P. (1913), pp. 424-430 (pdf = printed + 16); text from the Missale O.P. (1939), p. 139;
